  "document_notes": [
    "Workflow order is fixed: W01 take withdrawal slip → W02 fill account number → W03 enter withdrawal amount → W04 sign the withdrawal slip → W05 submit the slip to the cashier.",
    "The customer sentence “Yaan account number fill malthe? Nana dada malpodu?” indicates the account-number field is completed and maps to W03.",
    "The customer sentence “Yaan yeth kaas deppodu andh barethe? Nana dada malpodu yaan?” indicates the withdrawal amount has been filled and maps to W04.",
    "The customer sentence “Yaan slip g sign padeye? Eth ol submit malpodu?” indicates the slip is signed and maps to W05.",
    "Record each customer variation as its own CUSTOMER WAV. Record one ASSISTANT WAV per assistant workflow step.",
    "Customer and assistant audio should both be in Tulu. English meanings are included as dataset labels/reference.",
    "Do not add customer-name, date, cash-collection, or additional verification instructions; they are not included in the supplied withdraw.json workflow.",
    "The spelling “yeth” is retained in W03b exactly as corrected by the user; “Eth” remains in W04a as originally supplied.",
    "Assistant audio files",
    "W01_ASSISTANT.wav · W02_ASSISTANT.wav · W03_ASSISTANT.wav · W04_ASSISTANT.wav · W05_ASSISTANT.wav"
  ],
